{
  "name": "Nightly XML Sitemap Crawler to Keep AI Vector Knowledgebase 100% Fresh",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Nightly XML Sitemap Crawler to Keep AI Vector Knowledgebase 100% Fresh\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAutomatically crawl any site’s sitemap.xml every night and sync updated pages into your customer support RAG vector database.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify XML Sitemap Crawler & Knowledgebase Builder** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "d709ee0d-2f8b-4020-acdd-6eb827901a96",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ca87f6d3-52b0-48a5-ac58-ad046fe130c5",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4f5199c2-c029-43e9-a364-e6d31d327c5c",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"https://docs.n8n.io/sitemap.xml\",\"https://docs.apify.com/sitemap.xml\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "68d8fbb4-d7c0-4a38-aec9-3e177f042093",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "58272bb5-89f1-446d-a179-5db50f3168a4",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/laborious_rumor~sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, maxItems: $json.maxItems }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "c7953732-8d18-47b6-aa11-941d91b2602b",
      "name": "Run Apify XML Sitemap Crawler & Knowledgebase Builder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
